From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 07:17:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix(security): harden public API keys and /v1/check input

- Accept keys only via X-API-Key (query-string keys leak into logs/history)
- Enforce each key's hourly quota atomically (was stored but never enforced)
- Validate key name and cap rateLimitPerHour (1..1000); cap 10 active keys/user
- Add GET /v1/keys and DELETE /v1/keys/:id (ownership-scoped revocation)
- Validate /v1/check array sizes and element types
- Tests for the above

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
